\title{BiocKB: Bioconductor Knowledge Base for AI-Assisted Analysis}
\description{
Provides a pre-built retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) knowledge base derived from the source code, vignettes, and metadata of all Bioconductor packages. The database is hosted on ExperimentHub and cached locally via BiocFileCache. It is designed to be used by the BiocAI package suite to ground LLM responses in real Bioconductor documentation. Includes utilities to fetch, chunk, and manage the knowledge base.
